          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_queue_messages_unacked{queue=\"$queue\"})",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "已經送給 Worker、但還沒被 ack 的訊息。正常會在 0～prefetch(500)之間浮動。貼著 500 不動 = Worker 收了卻卡住沒處理完。"
    },
